        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>PDQ GT Series Miami Heavy Duty Grade 1 Commercial Door Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPDQ GT Series commercial levers are heavy duty Grade 1  and economically priced. Tested to more than 2 Million cycles (more than 2-1/2 times the  BHMA Grade 1 requirement) with virtually no lever sag.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAssembled in the USA meeting the requirements of the <b>Buy American Act</b>. Meets all applicable accessibility requirements of the ADA. These levers are heavy duty solid cast, with no plastic inserts, and fully adjustable for 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComplies with ANSI/BHMA A156.2-1996, Series 4000, Grade 1. Listed by UL / ULC for ratings of \u001cA\u001d  label (3 hours), UL10C / UBC 7-2 (1997) positive pressure, for single doors up to 4\u0019'0\"\u001d x 8'\u00190\"\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWindstorm Resistant Product Listing - ANSI A250.13-2003, ASTM E1886-02, ASTM E330-02. Outswing: 350 ft-lbs., Inswing: N/R, Design Load Rating: 1485 lbf.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications </b> for the PDQ GT Series Commercial Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" thick doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 161 door prep.</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Case: Heavy duty zinc die-cast, investment cast and chromated cold rolled steel mechanism. Billet steel spindles.</li>\r\n<li>Front: 2-1/4\" X 1-1/8\" Beveled 1/8\" on 2\".</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 4-7/8\" X 1-1/4\" (Standard ASA). Stainless steel, or wrought bronze.</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 9/16\" throw. Adjustable front for flat or beveled doors.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Trim: Miami levers solid zinc diecast.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 Years manufacturer's warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (ANSI F81):</b> Outside lever locked by push/turn button inside. When outside lever is locked by push button inside - key from outside or rotating inside lever unlocks outside lever. When outside lever is locked by pushing and turning the button inside - key from outside or rotating inside lever retracts the latch but does not unlock outside lever.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
